    "description": "A New Game Every hour!\r\nTest your knowledge & Answer Trivia Questions to collect the highest number of points & experience the thrill of winning Cash Prizes!\r\nThousands of questions covering all topics, from Technology, Sports, Culture, Movies, History, Games to General knowledge etc.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Fun Free trivia game\r\n\u2022 Get the chance to play every hour\r\n\u2022 Millions of players worldwide\r\n\u2022 Climb to the top of the leaderboard\r\n\u2022 Questions that include all subjects\r\n\u2022 Challenge yourself & others\r\n\u2022 Invite friends and get rewarded!\r\n\u2022 Get the top score and Win cash rewards\r\n\r\nFlip & Win is a new fun Pair matching game!\r\nPick two matching cards and the prize is yours.\r\n\r\nYou may watch videos to Unlock free power-ups Or you may subscribe to the bundles available on P & W\u2019s Shop to;\r\n\u2714 Get more lives\r\n\u2714 Swap questions\r\n\u2714 Remove 2 answers\r\n\u2714 Increase question time\r\n\u2714 Ask Audience\r\n\u2714 Play Without Ads\r\n\r\nHave any questions? You can contact us at support@playandwinapp.com\r\n\r\nFollow us on;\r\nFacebook: playandwinapp-facebook\r\nTwitter: playandwinapp-twitter\r\nInstagram: playandwinapp-instagram\r\nYouTube: playandwinapp-youtube\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for!\r\n\r\nDownload and start winning prize money today\r\n\r\nPlay & Win license agreement ( EULA ) :\r\nhttp://www.playandwinapp.com/eula\r\n\r\nPlay & Win privacy policy :\r\nhttp://www.playandwinapp.com/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nPlay & Win terms and conditions :\r\nhttp://www.playandwinapp.com/terms-conditions",
